data: {"id": "fb28d4d09dd0460e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1309", "run_id": "fb28d4d09dd0460e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与根因证据\n\n### 身份与生命周期\n- Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload` (UID: `d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6`) 当前处于 **CrashLoopBackOff** 状态，Restart Count = 14，已在 Kubelet 中反复重启 51 分钟，当前 Back-off 5 分钟。\n\n### 直接根因证据（已确认）\n\n1. **退出码为 78，原因 Error** — `kubectl describe` 显示 Last State Terminated Exit Code=78，Reason=Error。\n2. **日志确认缺失环境变量** — 前一次崩溃日志（kubectl previous logs）明确输出：`APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing`。Elasticsearch 日志在 30 分钟窗口内返回 6 条完全相同的内容。\n3. **Pod YAML 确认 Environment 为空** — `kube", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789143049778, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

